      "comment": "ASTON SUNSHINE (4) is a talented dog who is a winner of five races but missed the frame last time when seventh at Bendigo (24.58). Looks the one to beat on her best form. TRICK (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing eighth (20.82) in a Grade 4/5 at Traralgon. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Shapes as one to consider. KIANI STAR (7) turned in a moderate effort last time when seventh at Ballarat over 390m behind Elliot Nova (23.18) in a Grade 5. Key player if finds best. TRICKY DISCO (2) is always a threat when he draws this box.",
